<title>USA: Sterling sees no reason for stock drop.</title>
<headline>Sterling sees no reason for stock drop.</headline>
<dateline>EAST MEADOW, N.Y. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterling Vision Inc said Tuesday it is unaware of any facts and/or circumstances regarding its business, operations or other conditions that would cause the trading price of its common stock to decline.</p>
<p>The company's stock was down two at 6-1/8 in midafternoon trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>Sterling is one of the largest retail and franchised chains of optical stores and the second largest franchised optical chain in the United States.</p>
</text>
